menu "data_matrix"

    config DATA_MATRIX_PORTS
        int "Ports"
        default 32
        range 2 254
        help
          The ports the switch can hold: the modules', the providers' and
          the sessions'. One place is 16 bytes on the board.

    config DATA_MATRIX_TARGETS
        int "Targets of one port"
        default 8
        range 1 16
        help
          The ports one port's output can go to. A send copies them onto the
          sender's stack (a pointer each).

endmenu
